  "translation": "A yɛrɛ ye ⟨את⟩ a denw tɛmɛci tasuma kɔnɔ, Hinom denkɛ (Ben-Hinom) kɔgɔn kɔnɔ; a ye niyeli-daɲɛ kɛ, a ye taasifɔ kɛ, a ye sɔsɔliya kɛ; a ye suw-daɲɛbaga ni dɔnnikɛlaw di a yɛrɛ ma. A mɔgɔya kɛra ka jurumu caman kɛ Yawe ɲɛ na, walasa ka a sumaya.",
